<title>PHILIPPINES: Dharmala to form finance and leasing firm.</title>
<headline>Dharmala to form finance and leasing firm.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dharmala Philippines Inc said on Wednesday it was in the process of setting up a company named Dharmala finance and Leasing Corp.</p>
<p>Corporate secretary said in a statement the firm also set up a foundation named Dharmala Philippines Foundation Inc.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
